Package: rGSTB
Type: Package
Title: Programmatic and graphical interfaces to LTER-LIFE's NatureDataCube
Version: 0.1
Date: 2026-07-28
Author: Bruno Marcos, Lisa Tostrams
Maintainer: Bruno Marcos <brunoasmarcos@gmail.com>, Lisa Tostrams <lisa.tostrams@rivm.nl>
Description: A set of functions for formatting and manipulating geospatial datasets, as well as environmental annotation of ecological/biodiversity datasets, for dutch nature areas.
